      <p>  <p>Returns a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Integer/boolean" target="_blank">boolean</a> (an <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Integer" target="_blank">integer</a>) that is <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/TRUE" target="_blank">TRUE</a> if the <b>script</b> is running.</p>
</p>
